# mode|category|vault-relative path
# file:     include one exact file.
# tree:     include every file below an exact directory.
# globtree: expand a directory glob, then include every file below each match.
#
# What is deliberately absent: the personal profile (the distribution ships a
# standard one), 80-agents/memory/internal/, the journal's own contents, the
# Meli/Signals-specific skills, real application pages, and the AGENTS OS
# project note with its local roadmap and state.

# --- Conceptual map, invariants, conventions ---
file|core|80-agents/agents-os/agents-os.md
file|core|80-agents/agents-os/agent-constitution.md
file|core|80-agents/agents-os/context-router.md
file|core|90-system/convenciones.md
file|core|30-resources/00-RESOURCE-WIKI.md
file|core|30-resources/LLM Wiki.md

# --- Executable contracts (schema, note types, skills, Graphify) ---
tree|contracts|80-agents/skills/_shared

# --- Core AGENTS OS skills ---
file|skills|80-agents/skills/INDEX.md
globtree|skills|80-agents/skills/agents-os-*

# --- Portable, domain-agnostic skills ---
tree|skills|80-agents/skills/human-first-technical-writing
