tree|skills|80-agents/skills/write-once-conflict-triage

# --- Templates: System 1 and System 2 ---
tree|templates|80-agents/templates
tree|templates|70-templates

# --- Public memory about the system itself ---
tree|public-memory|80-agents/memory/public/decision/agents-os
tree|public-memory|80-agents/memory/public/known-error/agents-os
tree|public-memory|80-agents/memory/public/learning/agents-os
